BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d-contra-carrboro-20261113@same-time-next-week
DTSTAMP:20261113T190826Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261113T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261113T230000
SUMMARY:Contra Dance in Carrboro (2nd Fridays + New Year's Eve)
LOCATION:Carrboro Century Center\, 100 N Greensboro St\, Carrboro\, NC 2751
 0
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Country Dancers' flagship monthly contra with live mus
 ic and a beginner lesson\; friendly\, all-ages crowd that welcomes newcome
 rs.\n\nBeginner lesson at 7:30. Nov 13: Dead Sea Squirrels with caller Hal
  Schnee. The New Year's Eve dance (Contrazz!\, caller Barbara Groh) runs 8
 pm to midnight\, $18–40.\n\nHow to join: Just show up\; pay at the door\
 n\nBefore you go: January and February dates aren't posted yet. The hall i
 s about 12 miles from downtown Durham.\n\nhttps://www.tcdancers.org/new-ev
 ents\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.tcdancers.org/new-events
END:VEVENT
