BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d-swing-dance-20261121@same-time-next-week
DTSTAMP:20261113T190826Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261121T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261121T230000
SUMMARY:Triangle Swing Dance Society Dance Party
LOCATION:Carrboro Century Center\, 100 N Greensboro St\, Carrboro\, NC 2751
 0
DESCRIPTION:TSDS's monthly live-band swing dance with a free beginner lesso
 n\; no partner needed.\n\nIncluded beginner lesson 7pm\; live band (TBA) 8
 -11\; optional $5 'Beyond the Basics' lesson 6:45 at Carrboro Civic Club\n
 \nHow to join: Buy tickets on the TSDS site (open ~2 weeks before) or at t
 he door\n\nBefore you go: Only Nov 21 is posted so far. Dances are roughly
  monthly\, often on the 3rd Saturday\, so check for December through Febru
 ary dates.\n\nhttps://triangleswingdancesociety.squarespace.com/events\n\n
 Listed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://triangleswingdancesociety.squarespace.com/events
END:VEVENT
