 'all group (2\,800+ members)\, built to make figure drawing accessible\; b
 eginners and returning artists welcome.\n\nDoors 6:30\n\nHow to join: Get 
 a $10 ticket via the Draw Y'all Meetup\; bring your own supplies (no messy
  media)\; 18+\n\nBefore you go: Meets the first Monday of the month. Dec 7
 \, Jan 4 and Feb 1 aren't posted yet.\n\nhttps://www.meetup.com/drawyall/e
 vents/316966625/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.meetup.com/drawyall/events/316966625/
