LOCATION:Moon Dog Meadery & Bottle Shop\, 1104 Broad St\, Suite C\, Durham\
 , NC 27705
DESCRIPTION:Twice-weekly open board game night with 350+ games\; hosts seat
  newcomers into games\, so it's built for meeting people.\n\nHosted by the
  Durham Geeks Meetup\n\nHow to join: Just show up\; Durham Geeks Meetup / 
