 NC 27701
DESCRIPTION:Free weekly improv jam: names go in a bucket and everyone gets 
 on stage\; beginner-friendly on-ramp to Mettlesome's community.\n\nHarold 
 Night show ($8) at 7:30 just before\n\nHow to join: Just show up. Improv 1
 01 classes start early Jan 2027 (registration ~early Dec)\n\nBefore you go
 : Only Nov 5\, 12 and 19 are posted\, with none on Nov 26. Dec through Feb
  dates aren't posted yet.\n\nhttps://www.thisismettlesome.com/live\n\nList
 ed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://www.thisismettlesome.com/live
